{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A door that opens to places it shouldn\u2019t\u2014research labs, a darkened suburban street, endless tiled pools, and the yellow hum of somewhere you were never meant to be.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PICK YOUR DESTINATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/325435f2c2b8f2e42fbe343651ca1d18.poster.avif?t=1761332627\" width=900 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/325435f2c2b8f2e42fbe343651ca1d18.webm?t=1761332627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/325435f2c2b8f2e42fbe343651ca1d18.mp4?t=1761332627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hollow Complex</strong> is an action filled survival thriller inspired by Backrooms lore. Dive into a dark and twisted rendition of internet folklore that actually allows you to fight back! Explore a web of interconnected locations, unlock more destinations to travel to, and find new equipment/tools to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DYNAMIC SURFACES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Need something cleaned? Spray it off:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/12674c392533cc0552d7df1f2f11a735.poster.avif?t=1761332627\" width=850 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/12674c392533cc0552d7df1f2f11a735.webm?t=1761332627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/12674c392533cc0552d7df1f2f11a735.mp4?t=1761332627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keeping<i><strong> yourself</strong></i>\u00a0clean is also a top priority:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/38219a9cb19b3cca85a99683af921165.poster.avif?t=1761332627\" width=750 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/38219a9cb19b3cca85a99683af921165.webm?t=1761332627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/38219a9cb19b3cca85a99683af921165.mp4?t=1761332627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Interact with several dynamic surfaces to ignite fires, shock enemies, and more:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/3f84591d222741a1ff92a8edd5b8882f.poster.avif?t=1761332627\" width=850 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/3f84591d222741a1ff92a8edd5b8882f.webm?t=1761332627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/3f84591d222741a1ff92a8edd5b8882f.mp4?t=1761332627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p 